#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Statistics"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Collecting returns from institutions and turning counts into official, published figures. A core subdomain: official statistics are what an EMIS exists to produce."
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "Language"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Collection**: One cycle of gathering data from respondents with a given instrument. _Avoid_: Survey, data call"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Census**: A collection that covers every institution once a year at one reference date. _Avoid_: Annual survey, school return"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Instrument**: The versioned definition of a collection's items, rules, reference date, window and expected respondents. _Avoid_: Form, questionnaire, template"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Return**: One institution's response to an instrument. _Avoid_: Submission, survey response"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Attestation**: The head of an institution's confirmation that a return is complete and correct. _Avoid_: Sign-off, certification"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Snapshot**: A locked, versioned copy of data as at a reference date, from which official figures are computed. _Avoid_: Extract, dump"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Measure**: A named calculation over stored counts, defined once. _Avoid_: Metric, KPI, statistic"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Indicator**: A measure with published metadata, often one defined internationally. _Avoid_: KPI, metric"
msgstr ""

#: docs/specifications/domain/contexts/statistics/CONTEXT.md
msgid "**Publication**: The open release of aggregate statistics. _Avoid_: Open data dump, report, extract"
msgstr ""
